A node with the tag "time" always has a timestamp, so a partial date is a span.
-- input.html --
<body><time class="date" datetime="2026-09">September 2026</time></body>
-- want.html --
<!DOCTYPE html><html><head><title></title>
<link rel="canonical" href="http://example.com/"/></head>
<body data-id="0"><span data-id="1">September 2026</span></body></html>
